---
import { FACTS } from "../../data/facts";
---

<!-- ===== 1. HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--pill rv"><span>{FACTS.years}</span>&nbsp;Years of Executive Recruiting Experience</p>
        <h1 class="rv" style="--d:1">Executive Recruiting &amp; Career Solutions in New Jersey</h1>
        <p class="brandline rv" style="--d:2">Leading Candidates to Leading Companies.</p>

        <div class="hero-copy rv" style="--d:3">
          <p>Hiring Solutions Group has decades of experience working with both employers and professionals. We help companies identify, evaluate, and hire exceptional talent while helping accomplished professionals understand where they can create the greatest value next.</p>
          <p>Our approach goes deeper than resumes and job descriptions. We listen carefully, take notes, assess, interview, vet, and help our clients make better-informed decisions built for long-term success.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-actions rv" style="--d:4">
          <a class="btn" href="#hiring">Find the Right Talent <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#career">Explore Career Solutions</a>
        </div>

        <p class="legal rv" id="representation" style="--d:5">
          <span class="lbl">Representation</span>
          HSG represents only one side of an individual search or engagement. We do not accept compensation from both the hiring company and candidate in the same search. If a potential conflict occurs by coincidence, both parties are informed promptly so the situation can be resolved before proceeding.
          <span class="review">Final wording pending Crystal's review</span>
        </p>

        <p class="bridge rv" style="--d:6">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h10"/><path d="M11 7l5 5-5 5"/><path d="M20 4v16"/></svg>
          <span>Where does it go from here? When a company's needs extend beyond hiring into business growth, leadership, or HR, explore Business Solutions Group at <a href="https://bsg-edge.com/">BSG-edge.com</a>.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-fig rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="hero-img">
          <span class="ph">
            <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2.5"/><circle cx="9" cy="10" r="2.2"/><path d="M3 17.5l5-4.2 3.4 2.8L15.6 12 21 16.4"/></svg>
            <strong>Hero image</strong>
            <span>Executive / leadership environment. Premium business photography — no stock handshakes.</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="hero-badge">
          <b>{FACTS.placements}</b>
          <span>Placements across executive and specialized roles</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="proofbar rv">
      <div><b>{FACTS.years}</b><span>Years experience</span></div>
      <div><b>{FACTS.placements}</b><span>Placements</span></div>
      <div><b>{FACTS.network}</b><span>Professional network</span></div>
      <div><b>{FACTS.resumes}</b><span>Resumes accessible</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>